## 2. Launch — single headless run (one pass, no auto-retry)

Use this to test the setup or run a supervised pass:

```powershell
cd {{PROJECT_DIR}}

claude -p "Read CLAUDE.md and execute the active sprint using docs/develop/AGENT_EXECUTION_PROTOCOL.md. Work sequentially batch by batch. If a batch is BLOCKED for a non-quota reason, follow the Blocked-but-not-idle rule. Stop when the sprint is complete, nothing is workable, unsafe, or usage limits stop execution." --model {{MODEL}} --effort {{EFFORT}} --dangerously-skip-permissions
```

Optional spend cap for this run (stops at the budget limit; only with `-p`):

```powershell
claude -p "<same prompt>" --model {{MODEL}} --effort {{EFFORT}} --max-budget-usd 5 --dangerously-skip-permissions
```

