## 5. Monitor

```powershell
# Follow the watchdog lifecycle log live (start / exit code / waits)
Get-Content {{PROJECT_DIR}}\logs\claude-night-runner.log -Wait

# Full transcript of the latest run: thinking + tool calls + outputs (JSONL, one line per event)
$last = Get-ChildItem logs\runs\run-*.jsonl | Sort-Object LastWriteTime | Select-Object -Last 1
Get-Content $last.FullName -Wait

# Human-readable render of the latest run (text and thinking for each agent turn)
Get-Content $last.FullName | ForEach-Object { $_ | ConvertFrom-Json } |
  ForEach-Object { $_.message.content } | Where-Object { $_ } |
  ForEach-Object {
    if     ($_.type -eq 'thinking') { "THINK: $($_.thinking)" }
    elseif ($_.type -eq 'text')     { "TEXT : $($_.text)" }
    elseif ($_.type -eq 'tool_use') { "TOOL : $($_.name)" }
  }

# What the agent has done / where it is heading (handoff log)
Get-Content docs\develop\AGENT_PROGRESS.md -Tail 40

# Work produced: branches and commits
git branch --list "claude/*"
git log --oneline -15

# Current plan state (which batch is IN_PROGRESS / BLOCKED / DONE)
Select-String -Path docs\develop\SPRINTS.md -Pattern "Status:"
```

